            Sign in to Slack

            1. Open your workspace in a browser and sign in as usual.
            2. Open the developer tools (Cmd+Option+I), choose the Network tab and
               reload the page.
            3. Right-click any request whose address has /api/ and choose
               Copy > Copy as cURL.
            4. Paste it here (Cmd+V).

            The token and the cookies go to the macOS Keychain and nowhere else. slakio
            only reads: it sends no message and marks nothing as read.

            Waiting for the paste…

            Ctrl+Q  Quit
            ?       Keyboard help







 NORMAL                                           │ Cmd+V paste · Ctrl+Q quit · ? help · : commands
